                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1e466ba8-4593-406f-a1cd-c03c57eb41d2",
                        "entry_id": "b9673713-4e8a-3a05-917e-aab64a48b07c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "matriarchies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ec2d4c3-6f1e-33ef-a192-823d0bb7f2e1",
                        "entry_id": "b9673713-4e8a-3a05-917e-aab64a48b07c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Société ou situation où les mères (ou par extension les femmes et dans une société animale les femelles) détiennent l'autorité, le pouvoir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e21ac3a-49f7-4058-8120-9500aaadaefa",
                                "sense_id": "9ec2d4c3-6f1e-33ef-a192-823d0bb7f2e1",
                                "text": "Les éléphants vivent dans une matriarchie : la femelle dominante expulse de la harde les mâles en âge de se reproduire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c86e4ca5-bb18-4ec3-8755-0d2c83cd0a39",
                                "sense_id": "9ec2d4c3-6f1e-33ef-a192-823d0bb7f2e1",
                                "text": "Même au sens le plus limité et le plus individuel, toutes les femmes dans une matriarchie ont une souveraineté personnelle au sens où elles sont libres de régner sur elles-mêmes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e5da539-6f3c-4a5f-9064-140c82a3ecfd",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9673713-4e8a-3a05-917e-aab64a48b07c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9ec2d4c3-6f1e-33ef-a192-823d0bb7f2e1",
                        "target_lang_word": "Matriarchat",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Matriarchat",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44f7c372-5e42-3f27-ba38-88ff974f7e30",
                                        "entry_id": "44eda363-73e9-338c-bffb-e4e71a3d5b80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gesellschaftsform, bei der Frauen eine bevorzugte Rolle innehaben"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f16a5f9-8d11-4ff4-a6fa-50d3adedec5b",
                                                "sense_id": "44f7c372-5e42-3f27-ba38-88ff974f7e30",
                                                "text": "Matriarchate gibt es in vielen Teilen der Welt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19242645-3847-4e9e-b8de-c62b16a6082f",
                                                "sense_id": "44f7c372-5e42-3f27-ba38-88ff974f7e30",
                                                "text": "„Das Matriarchat indessen, eine »Herrschaft der Mütter«, von der manche europäische Forscher früher ausgingen, hat es in Afrika höchstwahrscheinlich nie gegeben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8811004-148b-440a-aaba-e70c5ce43f84",
                                                "sense_id": "44f7c372-5e42-3f27-ba38-88ff974f7e30",
                                                "text": "„Denn die eigentlich geforderte Ausweitung der Väterzone stößt an ein schwer zu überwindendes Hindernis: die Macht des Matriarchats in der institutionellen Kinderbetreuung und in den eigenen vier Wänden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dbf60781-498d-4758-b662-2242522dafc5",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9673713-4e8a-3a05-917e-aab64a48b07c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9ec2d4c3-6f1e-33ef-a192-823d0bb7f2e1",
                        "target_lang_word": "matriarchy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "matriarchy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69683383-98f6-37bc-9400-0d9e679367f5",
                                        "entry_id": "367316ed-3faf-3f1e-bcba-e72974a162e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A social system in which the mother is head of household, having authority over men and children, and lineage is traced through the female line."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f460561b-3e6c-4124-b43d-3e70d0b9a6df",
                                                "sense_id": "69683383-98f6-37bc-9400-0d9e679367f5",
                                                "text": "The difficulty is that when a man thinks of matriarchy, he thinks of a patriarchy with women in the place of men; he does not stop to consider that matriarchy may be a complete mirror-image. Where patriarchy establishes law, matriarchy establishes custom; where patriarchy establishes military power, matriarchy establishes religious authority; where patriarchy encourages the aresteia of the individual warrior, matriarchy encourages the tradition-bound cohesion of the collective. When, therefore, one envisions a matriarchy, one should not conjure up visions of a gang of Amazons lopping off breasts and testicles to rule by force of arms."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff74f721-5b5f-3ff9-9e80-9a7a066e41ad",
                                        "entry_id": "367316ed-3faf-3f1e-bcba-e72974a162e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A system of government by females (particularly as a kind of polity)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcccc660-115d-3098-a078-1b15b146fed4",
                                        "entry_id": "367316ed-3faf-3f1e-bcba-e72974a162e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The dominance of women in social or cultural systems."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
